<h2>Towards Industry 5.0 vision</h2>
The next generation digital twins should not simply collect more building data. Instead, they should help
buildings understand the people they are designed to serve.
Our proposed digital twin system framework represents an early step twoards this vision by integrating
physical building asset, digital intelligence, and human experiences into a unified framework.

This transition marks a critcal milestone to support the ambitions of Industry 5.0, where AI augments human decision-making.
</p>


